**Boundaries**

- Public subnets host only ingress endpoints (ALB / API Gateway / NAT).
- Private subnets host stateless compute and caches; default-deny east-west.
- Data subnets host stateful tiers (databases, vector stores, brokers); accessible only from approved app-tier security groups.
- All outbound internet traffic egresses via NAT / proxy with allow-listed destinations.
